<title>USA: Florida to sell $18.52 million regents' bonds.</title>
<headline>Florida to sell $18.52 million regents' bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TALLAHASSEE, Fla 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida will sell $18.52 million of Board of Regents revenue bonds by competitive bid with 20 hours notice, the Division of Bond Finance said Friday.</p>
<p>The issue is designated Board of Regents, University of Central Florida Housing Revenue Bonds, Series 1996.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
